  m_Name: Evento_TragediaDosComunsUrbana
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Trag\xE9dia dos Comuns Urbana"
  _titleEn: Urban Tragedy of the Commons
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Garrett Hardin descreveu em 1968 a trag\xE9dia dos comuns: quando cada
    um usa um recurso compartilhado pensando s\xF3 em si, o recurso se esgota para
    todos."
  _summaryEn: 'Garrett Hardin described the tragedy of the commons in 1968: when
    everyone uses a shared resource thinking only of themselves, it runs out for
    all.'
  _realWorld: "Elinor Ostrom, Nobel de Economia em 2009, mostrou que comunidades
    conseguem gerir bens comuns com regras pr\xF3prias, sem depender s\xF3 do governo
    ou do mercado."
  _realWorldEn: Elinor Ostrom, winner of the 2009 Nobel Prize in Economics, showed
    that communities can manage common goods with their own rules, without relying
    only on government or markets.
  _tradeOffs: "Regras claras, fiscaliza\xE7\xE3o e participa\xE7\xE3o dos usu\xE1rios
    protegem os bens comuns."
  _tradeOffsEn: Clear rules, monitoring and user participation protect common goods.
  _sources:
  - Label: Tragedy of the commons (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tragedy_of_the_commons
  - Label: Nobel, Elinor Ostrom (2009)
    Url: https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/economic-sciences/2009/ostrom/facts/
